{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11143","headline":"寓目 · 杜甫","name":"寓目","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一县蒲萄熟，秋山苜蓿多。\n关云常带雨，塞水不成河。\n羌女轻烽燧，胡儿制骆驼。\n自伤迟暮眼，丧乱饱经过。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_11143.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11143","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《杜诗详注》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/杜詩詳註_(四庫全書本)）"}